{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Kickers! is a top-down action-adventure in which you explore a mysterious island in search of missing exorcists. Defeat evil yokai and claim their powers to free a fantastical land - inspired by Japanese myths and legends - of its curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single-Player Story <br>A grand adventure across the cursed island of Seraiken, filled with ruins and long-lost places. Visit the sacred remains of the order - a place of rest and a gathering ground for lost souls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hundred-Storied Pagoda <br>It awaits those who seek the ultimate challenge, as each floor grows harder and deadlier. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer Arena <br>Challenge friends and rivals, on the same screen or online, and choose from a selection of legendary exorcists. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Map Designer  <br>Create, customize, and share your own maps with a global community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939080/extras/90fe1933d71759cec45a27f5d88be79f.avif?t=1756842979\" width=460 height=370 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless adventures await - in Ghost Kickers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2939080?t=1756842979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756842979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756842979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756842979","categories":[{"descr